OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife park up for sale 40 years
OL,4,Aafter opening
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wildlife park has gone on the market
OL,7,F40 years after it first opened its
OL,8,Fdoors.
OL,10,FCombe Martin Wildlife and Dinosaur Park
OL,11,Fin north Devon announced the sale
OL,12,Ffollowing "significant increases in
OL,13,Foperating costs".
OL,15,FThe attraction was founded in 1986 and
OL,16,Fremained under the ownership of the
OL,17,FGilbert family, who said a new owner
OL,18,Fwith "financial resources" would be the
OL,19,Fbest way to secure the park's future.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
