OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife park up for sale 40 years
OL,4,Aafter opening
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This has been an incredibly difficult
OL,7,Fdecision for our family," joint owners
OL,8,FDawn and Alan Gilbert said in a
OL,9,Fstatement. "Running a zoo and major
OL,10,Fvisitor attraction has become
OL,11,Fincreasingly expensive, while
OL,12,Fcontinuing to develop a site like this
OL,13,Frequires substantial investment."
